//! Test infrastructure for orpheus-ui
//!
//! This module provides the foundation for three-tier testing:
//!
//! - **Unit tests**: In-file tests for individual components (scroll tests { })
//! - **Integration tests**: Cross-component interaction tests
//! - **E2E tests**: Full workflow tests with friction metrics
//!
//! ## Usage
//!
//! ```sigil
//! invoke crate·tests·{TestApp, WorkflowMetrics, TaskComplexity};
//! invoke crate·tests·fixtures·test_multitrack_project;
//! invoke crate·tests·assertions·assert_db_eq;
//! ```
//!
//! ## Modules
//!
//! - `test_harness` - TestApp simulation and WorkflowMetrics
//! - `test_fixtures` - Pre-configured projects for various scenarios
//! - `assertions` - Domain-specific assertion helpers
//! - `audio_controls_integration` - Integration tests for audio widgets
//! - `audio_controls_e2e` - E2E workflow tests with friction metrics
//! - `mixer_integration` - Integration tests for mixer components
//! - `mixer_e2e` - E2E workflow tests for mixing workflows

☉ scroll test_harness;
☉ scroll test_fixtures;
☉ scroll assertions;
☉ scroll audio_controls_integration;
☉ scroll audio_controls_e2e;
☉ scroll mixer_integration;
☉ scroll mixer_e2e;

